---
subject: <%= it.inviterName %> invited you to join <%= it.orgName %> on <%= it.appName %>
---
<h1 style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;color:#09090b;">You've been invited</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#3f3f46;"><strong><%= it.inviterName %></strong> has invited you to join <strong><%= it.orgName %></strong> on <strong><%= it.appName %></strong><% if (it.role) { %> as <strong><%= it.role %></strong><% } %>.</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:24px 0;"><tr><td align="center" style="border-radius:8px;background-color:#2563eb;"><a href="<%= it.url %>" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 26px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;">Accept invitation</a></td></tr></table>
<p style="margin:16px 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#71717a;">If the button doesn't work, copy and paste this URL into your browser:<br /><a href="<%= it.url %>" style="color:#2563eb;text-decoration:none;word-break:break-all;"><%= it.url %></a></p>
<p style="margin:20px 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#71717a;">If you weren't expecting this invitation, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
===TEXT===
You've been invited to <%= it.orgName %>

<%= it.inviterName %> has invited you to join <%= it.orgName %> on
<%= it.appName %><% if (it.role) { %> as <%= it.role %><% } %>.

Accept the invitation by opening the link below:

  <%= it.url %>

If you weren't expecting this invitation, you can safely ignore this email.
